1784335973.514 RX Newhaven, Adventurer's Guild
1784335973.515 RX     This nicely crafted room is well furnished and decorated with things that
1784335973.515 RX you have never seen before, from strange exotic weapons, to swirling vials of
1784335973.515 RX liquid. A well toned man, stands in front of a practice mat with his arms
1784335973.515 RX crossed. He stands up lightly at your approach, looks you up and down, and
1784335973.515 RX breaks into a lopsided grin. 
1784335973.515 RX Also here: Corwyn.
1784335973.515 RX Obvious exits: south
1784335973.515 PART [HP=35/KAI=2]:
