1784335989.539 RX Newhaven, Narrow Road
1784335989.539 RX     This narrow road is quite plain save for the various lanterns hanging from
1784335989.539 RX the trees around, and a large stone stairwell leading downwards. You hear the
1784335989.539 RX clash of steel below you, and cries of pain and triumph accompanying it. Stone
1784335989.539 RX buildings lie to your north and west. 
1784335989.539 RX Also here: Oracle.
1784335989.539 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west, down
