1784335993.948 RX [HP=35/KAI=2]:Newhaven, Forest Path
1784335993.949 RX     The trees become very thick around you now, and you can barely see where
1784335993.949 RX you're going due to the only light source being from the village behind you and
1784335993.949 RX the light shining through the trees. You hear the sound of rippling water south
1784335993.949 RX of here. 
1784335993.949 RX Also here: Oracle.
1784335993.949 RX Obvious exits: south, northwest
